# What never reaches a build context, and therefore never reaches a server.
#
# Coolify builds from the git repository, where most of this is absent already.
# This file is for the other case — `docker build .` from a working tree — and
# the first entry is the reason it exists rather than a tidiness measure.

# Real customer data. `legacy/mirzabot-php/db/` holds the production MySQL dump:
# 11,241 Telegram identities, 4,629 payments, card numbers. It is gitignored, so
# it is only ever here, on this machine — and a build context is exactly how it
# would stop being only here.
legacy/

node_modules
**/node_modules

# Rebuilt inside the image. Copying a Windows-built dist into a Linux image is
# how a stale asset ships without anyone choosing it.
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
graphify-out/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/

# Secrets. `sim/.env.local` carries the test bot token.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
sim/.env.local

# Nothing in the image reads these.
docs/
**/*.md
!deploy/README.md
test-results
playwright-report
